{
  "title": "Dua Adeela",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nشَهِدَ اللَّهُ اَنَّهٗ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nSHAHEDAL LAAHO ANNAHU LAA ELAAHA ILLAA HOWA\n“Allah bears witness that there is no god but He,\nوَالْمَلائِكَةُ وَاولُوا الْعِلْمِ\nWAL MALAAA-EKATO WA OOLUL I’LME\nand (so do) the angels and those possessed of knowledge,\nقَائِماً بِالْقِسْطِ\nQAAA-EMAN BIL-QISTE\nmaintaining His creation with justice;\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ الْعَزِيزُ الْحَكِيمُ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAA HOWAL A’ZEEZUL HAKEEMO\nthere is no god but He, the Mighty, the Wise.\nاِنَّ الدِّينَ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ الاِسْلَامُ\nINNAD DEENA I’NDAL LAAHIL ISLAAMO\nSurely, the (true) religion with Allah is Islam.”\nوَانَا الْعَبْدُ الضَّعِيفُ الْمُذْنِبُ\nWA ANAL A’BDUZ ZA-E’EFUL MUZNEBO\nI am the slave—feeble, sinful,\nالْعَاصِي الْمُحْتَاجُ الْحَقِيرُ\nAL-A’ASIL MOHTAAJUL HAQEERO\ndisobedient, needy, and ignoble—\nاَشْهَدُ لِمُنْعِمِي وَخَاِلقِي\nASH-HADO LE-MUN-E’MEE WA KHAALEQEE\nI testify to my Benefactor, Creator,\nوَرَازِقِي وَمُكْرِمِي\nWA RAAZEQEE WA MUKREMEE\nProvider of me with my sustenance, and my Honorer,\nكَمَا شَهِدَ لِذَاتِهٖ\nKAMAA SHAHEDA LE-ZAATEHI\nas same as He has testified to Himself\nوَشَهِدَتْ لَهُ الْمَلائِكَةُ\nWA SHAHEDAT LAHUL MALAAA-EKATO\nand the angels have testified to Him\nوَاولُوا الْعِلْمِ مِنْ عِبَادِهٖ\nWA OOLUL I’LME MIN E’BAADEHI\nso have those possessed with knowledge amongst His servants\nبِانَّهٗ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nBE-ANNAHU LAA ELAAHA ILLAA HOWA\nthat there is no god save Him\nذُو النِّعَمِ وَالاِحْسَانِ\nZUN NE-A’ME WAL EHSAANE\nthe Lord of bounties, favors,\nوَالْكَرَمِ وَالاِمْتِنَانِ\nWAL KARAME WAL IMTENAANE\ngenerosity, and kindness.\nقَادِرٌ ازَلِيٌّ\nQAADERUN AZALIYYUN\nHe is Omnipotent, Eternal,\nعَالِمٌ ابَدِيٌّ\nA’ALEMUN ABADIYYUN\nAll-knowing, Everlasting,\nحَيٌّ احَدِيٌّ\nHAYYUN AHADIYYUN\nEver-living, One and Only,\nمَوْجُودٌ سَرْمَدِيٌّ\nMAWJOODUN SARMADIYYUN\nSelf-existent, Endless,\nسَمِيعٌ بَصِيرٌ\nSAMEE-U’N BASEERUN\nAll-hearing, All-Seeing,\nمُرِيدٌ كَارِهٌ\nMOREEDUN KAAREHUN\nWilling, Disapproving,\nمُدْرِكٌ صَمَدِيٌّ\nMUDREKUN SAMADIYYUN\nAll-aware, and eternally Besought of all.\nيَسْتَحِقُّ هٰذِهِ الصِّفَاتُ\nYASTAHIQQO HAAZEHIS SEFAATO\nHe is worthy of all these attributes,\nوَهُوَ عَلَىٰ مَا هُوَ عَلَيْهِ فِي عِزِّ صِفَاتِهٖ\nWA HOWA A’LAA MAA HOWA A’LAYHE FEE I’ZZE SEFAATEHI\nand He, characterized by all these sublime attributes,\nكَانَ قَوْيّاً قَبْلَ وُجُودِ الْقُدْرَةِ وَالْقُوَّةِ\nKAANA QAWIYYAN QABLA WOJOODIL QUDRATE WAL QUWWATE\nwas All-powerful prior to the existence of might and power,\nوَكَانَ عَلِيماً قَبْلَ اِيجَادِ الْعِلْمِ وَالْعِلَّةِ\nWA KAANA A’ALEMAN QABLA EEJAADIL I’LME WAL I’LLATE\nand All-knowing before the origination of knowledge and reason.\nلَمْ يَزَلْ سُلْطَاناً اِذْ لَا مَمْلَكَةَ وَلَا مَالَ\nLAM YAZAL SULTAANAN IZ LAA MAMLAKATA WA LAA MAALA\nHe has been always Authority when there was neither sovereignty nor wealth.\nوَلَمْ يَزَلْ سُبْحَاناً عَلَىٰ جَمِيعِ الاحْوَاِل\nWA LAM YAZAL SUBHAANAN A’LAA JAMEE-I’L AHWAALE\nHe has been always Glorious under all circumstances.\nوُجُودُهٗ قَبْلَ الْقَبْلِ فِي اَزَلِ الآزَاِل\nWOJOODOHU QABLAL QABLE FEE AZALIL AAZAALE\nHis Being is before all precedence in the pre-eternity of sempiternity.\nوَبَقَاؤُهٗ بَعْدَ الْبَعْدِ مِنْ غَيْرِ انتِقَالٍ وَلَا زَوَالٍ\nWA BAQAAA-OHU BA’DAL BA’DE MIN GHAYRIN TEQAALINW WA LAA ZAWAALIN\nHis Remaining will be after all endings without any extinction or disappearance.\nغَنِيٌّ فِي الاوَّلِ وَالآخِرِ\nGHANIYYUN FIL AWWALE WAL AAKHERE\nHe is self-Sufficient at the beginning and at the end\nمُسْتَغْنٍ فِي الْبَاطِنِ وَالظَّاهِرِ\nMUSTAGHNIN FIL BAATENE WAZ ZAAHERE\nand All-independent inwardly and outwardly.\nلَا جَوْرَ فِي قَضِيَّتِهٖ\nLAA JAWRA FEE QAZIYYATEHI\nThere is no injustice in His judgment,\nوَلَا مَيْلَ فِي مَشِيئَتِهٖ\nWA LAA MAYLA FEE MASHEE-ATEHI\nnor is there unfairness in His management,\nوَلَا ظُلْمَ فِي تَقْدِيرِهٖ\nWA LAA ZULMA FEE TAQDEEREHI\nnor is there unfairness in His administration,\nوَلَا مَهْرَبَ مِنْ حُكُومَتِهٖ\nWA LAA MAHRABA MIN HOKOOMATEHI\nnor is there any escape from His sovereignty,\nوَلَا مَلْجَا مِنْ سَطَوَاتِهٖ\nWA LAA MALJAA MIN SATAWAATEHI\nnor is there any shelter against His firm grip,\nوَلَا مَنجىٰ مِنْ نَقِمَاتِهٖ\nWA LAA MANJAN MIN NAQEMATEHI\nnor is there any salvation from His punishment.\nسَبَقَتْ رَحْمَتُهٗ غَضَبَهٗ\nSABAQAT RAHMATOHU GHAZABAHU\nHis mercy overtakes His Wrath.\nوَلَا يَفُوتُهٗ اَحَدٌ اِذَا طَلَبَهُ\nWA LAA YAFOOTOHU AHADUN EZAA TALABAHU\nNone can escape Him when He summons.\nازَاحَ الْعِلَلَ فِي التَّكْلِيفِ\nAZAAHAL E’LALA FIT TAKLEEFE\nHe has removed all excuses in (imposing) obligations,\nوَسَوَّىٰ التَّوْفِيقَ بَيْنَ الضَّعِيفِ وَالشَّرِيفِ\nWA SAWWAT TAWFEEQA BAYNAZ ZA-E’EFE WASH SHAREEFE\ntreats absolutely equally the weak and the noble,\nمَكَّنَ اَدَاءَ الْمَامُورِ\nMAKKANA ADAAA-AL MAAMOORE\nmakes capable to carry out His commands,\nوَسَهَّلَ سَبِيلَ اجْتِنَابِ الْمَحْظُورِ\nWA SAHHALA SABEELAJ TENAABIL MAHZOORE\nand makes easy to abstain from His prohibitions.\nلَمْ يُكَلِّفِ الطَّاعَةَ اِلَّا دُونَ الْوُسْعِ وَالطَّاقَةِ\nLAM YOKALLEFIT TAA-A’TA ILLAA DOONAL WUS-E’ WAT TAAQATE\nHe does not make obedience a burden but according to one's real capacity.\nسُبْحَانَهٗ مَا ابْيَنَ كَرَمَهٗ\nSUBHAANAHU MAA ABYANA KARAMAHU\nAll glory be to Him! How manifest His generosity is!\nوَاعْلَىٰ شَانَهٗ\nWA A-A’LAA SHAANAHU\nHow sublime His standing is!\nسُبْحَانَهٗ مَا اَجَلَّ نَيلَهٗ\nSUBHAANAHU MAA AJALLA NAYLAHU\nAll glory be to Him! How magnificent His bestowal is!\nوَاعْظَمَ اِحْسَانَهٗ\nWA A-A’ZAMA EHSAANAHU\nHow splendid His favors are!\nبَعَثَ الانْبِيَاءَ لِيُبَيِّنَ عَدْلَهٗ\nBA-A’SAL ANBEYAAA-A LE-YOBAYYENA A’DLAHU\nHe has sent the Prophets in order to show His justice,\nوَنَصَبَ الاوْصِيَاءَ لِيُظْهِرَ طَوْلَهٗ وَفَضْلَهٗ\nWA NASABAL AWSEYAAA-A LE-YUZHERA TAWLAHU WA FAZLAHU\nand appointed successors [for the Prophets] in order to make known His munificence and grace.\nوَجَعَلَنَا مِنْ امَّةِ سَيِّدِ الانْبِيَاءِ\nWA JA-A’LANAA MIN UMMATE SAYYEDIL ANBEYAAA-E\nHe has made us of the community of the Chief of Prophets,\nوَخَيْرِ الاوْلِيَاءِ\nWA KHAYRIL AWLEYAAA-E\nthe most favorable of His saints,\nوَافْضَلِ الاصْفِيَاءِ\nWA AFZALIL ASFEYAAA-E\nthe best of His elite ones,\nوَاعْلىٰ الازْكِيَاءِ\nWA A-A’LAL AZKEYAAA-E\nand the most sublime of the pure ones;\nمُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّىٰ اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهٖ وَسَلَّمَ\nMOHAMMADIN SALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI WA SALLAMA\nthat is Muhammad, may Allah send blessings and benedictions upon him and his Household.\nآمَنَّا بِهٖ وَبِمَا دَعَانَا اِلَيْهِ\nAAMANNAA BEHI WA BEMAA DA-A’ANAA ELAYHE\nWe thus believe in him, in all that to which he has called us,\nوَبِالْقُرْآنِ الَّذِي انْزَلَهٗ عَلَيْهِ\nWA BIL-QUR-AANIL LAZEE ANZALAHU A’LAYHE\nin the Qur'an which He revealed to him,\nوَبِوَصِيِّهِ الَّذِي نَصَبَهٗ يَوْمَ الْغَدِيرِ\nWA BE-WASIYYEHIL LAZEE NASABAHU YAWMAL GHADEERE\nand in his Successor whom he appointed on the Ghadir Day\nوَاشَارَ اِلَيْهِ بِقَوْلِهٖ: \"هٰذَا عَلِيٌّ\"\nWA ASHAARA ELAYHE BE-QAWLEHI HAAZAA A’LIYYUN\nand to whom he referred by saying, “This is `Ali.”\nوَاشْهَدُ اَنَّ الائِمَّةَ الابْرَارَ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAL A-IMMATAL ABRAARA\nI also bear witness that the Imams—the pious\nوَالْخُلَفَاءَ الاخْيَارَ\nWAL KHOLAFAAA-AL AKHYAARA\nand benign vicegerents [of Allah]\nبَعْدَ الرَّسُولِ الْمُخْتَارِ\nBA’DAR RASOOLIL MUKHTAARE\nafter the Chosen Prophet are:\nعَلِيٌّ قَامِعُ الْكُفَّارِ\nA’LIYYUN QAAME-U’L KUFFAARE\n`Ali, the subduer of the infidels.\nوَمِنْ بَعْدِهٖ سَيِّدُ اوْلَادِهِ الْحَسَنُ بْنُ عَلِيٍّ\nWA MIM BA’DEHI SAYYEDO AWLAADEHIL HASANUBNO A’LIYYIN\nFollowing him is the chief of his sons, al-Hasan, the son of `Ali.\nثُمَّ اخُوهُ السِّبْطُ التَّابِعُ لِمَرْضَاةِ اللَّهِ الْحُسَيْنُ\nSUMMA AKHOOHUS SIBTUT TAABE-O’ LE-MARZAATIL LAAHIL HOSAYNO\nThen comes his brother, the grandson and seeker of Allah’s pleasure; al-Husayn.\nثُمَّ الْعَابِدُ عَلِيٌّ\nSUMMAL A’ABEDO A’LIYYUN\nThen comes `Ali, the [distinctive] worshipper [of Allah].\nثُمَّ الْبَاقِرُ مُحَمَّدٌ\nSUMMAL BAAQERO MOHAMMADUN\nThen comes the Splitter (of knowledge), Muhammad.\nثُمَّ الصَّادِقُ جَعْفَرٌ\nSUMMAS SAADEQO JA’FARUN\nThen comes the veracious Ja`far.\nثُمَّ الْكَاظِمُ مُوسَىٰ\nSUMMAL KAAZEMO MOOSAA\nThen comes the suppressor of rage, Musa.\nثُمَّ الرِّضَا عَلِيٌّ\nSUMMAR REZAA A’LIYYUN\nThen comes the pleased, `Ali.\nثُمَّ التَّقِيُّ مُحَمَّدٌ\nSUMMAT TAQIYYO MOHAMMADUN\nThen comes the pious, Muhammad.\nثُمَّ النَّقِيُّ عَلِّيٌّ\nSUMMAN NAQIYYO A’LIYYUN\nThen comes the refined, `Ali.\nثُمَّ الزَّكِيُّ الْعَسْكَرِيُّ الْحَسَنُ\nSUMMAZ ZAKIYYUL A’SKARIYYUL HASANO\nThen comes the pure resident of `Askar, al-Hasan.\nثُمَّ الْحُجَّةُ الْخَلَفُ الْقَائِمُ\nSUMMAL HUJJATUL KHALAFUL QAAA-EMO\nThen comes the Argument, Successor, Assumer,\nالْمُنْتَظَرُ الْمَهْدِيُّ الْمُرْجَىٰ\nAL-MUNTAZARUL MAHDIYYUL MURJAA\nAwaited, Well-guided, and Expected\nالَّذِي بِبَقَائِهٖ بَقِيَتِ الدُّنْيَا\nALLAZEE BE-BAQAAA-EHI BAQEYATID DUNYAA\non account of whose existence, this world is kept in existence,\nوَبِيُمْنِهٖ رُزِقَ الْوَرَىٰ\nWA BE-YUMNEHI ROZEQAL WARAA\non account of whose blessing, the created beings are provided sustenance,\nوَبِوُجُودِهٖ ثَبَتَتِ الارْضُ وَالسَّمَاءُ\nWA BE-WOJOODEHI SABATATIL ARZO WAS SAMAAA-O\nand on account of whose existence, the earth and the sky are kept in firmness.\nوَبِهٖ يَمْلَا اللَّهُ الارْضَ قِسْطاً وَعَدْلاً\nWA BEHI YAMLA-UL LAAHUL ARZA QISTANW WA A’DLAN\nThrough him, Allah shall fill the earth with equity and justice\nبَعْدَ مَا مُلِئَتْ ظُلْماً وَجَوْراً\nBA’DA MAA MOLE-AT ZULMANW WA JAWRAN\nafter it will be filled with inequity and injustice.\nوَاشْهَدُ اَنَّ اقْوَالَهُمْ حُجَّةً\nWA ASH-HADO ANNA AQWAALAHUM HUJJATUN\nI also bear witness that their words are decisive arguments,\nوَامْتِثَالَهُمْ فَرِيضَةً\nWAM TESAALAHUM FAREEZATUN\nto comply with their orders is obligatory,\nوَطَاعَتَهُم مَفْرُوضَةً\nWA TAA-A’TAHUM MAFROOZATUN\nthe obedience to them is commissioned [by Allah],\nوَمَوَدَّتَهُمْ لازِمَةً مَقْضِيَّةً\nWA MAWADDATAHUM LAAZEMATUM MAQZIYYATUN\nto love them is necessary and pre-ordained,\nوَالاِقْتِدَاءُ بِهٖم مُنجِيَةً\nWAL IQTEDAAA-A BEHIM MUNJEYATUN\nand to pattern after them will definitely achieve salvation,\nوَمُخَالَفَتَهُم مُرْدِيَةً\nWA MOKHAALAFATAHUM MURDEYATUN\nbut to oppose them will definitely bring about destruction.\nوَهُمْ سَادَاتُ اهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ اَجْمَعِينَ\nWA HUM SAADAATO AHLIL JANNATE AJMA-E’ENA\nThey are, moreover, the chiefs of all the inhabitants of Paradise,\nوَشُفَعَاءُ يَوْمِ الدِّينِ\nWA SHOFA-A’A-O YAWMID DEENE\nthe interceders on the Judgment Day,\nوَائِمَّةُ اهْلِ الارْضِ عَلىٰ الْيَقِينِ\nWA A-IMMATO AHLIL ARZE A’LAL YAQEENE\nand, undoubtedly, the leaders of the inhabitants of the earth,\nوَافْضَلُ الاوْصِيَاءِ الْمَرْضِيِّينَ\nWA AFZALUL AWSEYAAA-IL MARZIYYEENA\nand the best of the satisfied Successors [of the Prophets].\nوَاشْهَدُ اَنَّ الْمَوْتَ حَقٌّ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAL MAWTA HAQQUN\nI also bear witness that death is certain,\nوَمُسَاءَلَةَ مُنْكَرٍ وَنَكِيرٍ فِي الْقَبْرِ حَقٌّ\nWA MOSAAA-ALATA MUNKARINW WA NAKEERIN FIL QABRE HAQQUN\nthe interrogation by Munkar and Nakir in the grave is certain,\nوَالْبَعْثَ حَقٌّ\nWAL BA’SA HAQQUN\nthe raising of the dead is certain,\nوَالنُّشُورَ حَقٌّ\nWAN NOSHOORA HAQQUN\nthe final assemblage is certain,\nوَالصِّرَاطَ حَقٌّ\nWAS SERAATA HAQQUN\nthe Discriminating Bridge is certain,\nوَالْمِيزَانَ حَقٌّ\nWAL MEEZAANA HAQQUN\nthe Scales [of deeds] is certain,\nوَالْحِسَابَ حَقٌّ\nWAL HESAABA HAQQUN\nthe calling into account is certain,\nوَالْكِتَابَ حَقٌّ\nWAL KETAABA HAQQUN\nthe record book [of deeds] is certain,\nوَالْجَنَّةَ حَقٌّ\nWAL JANNATA HAQQUN\nParadise is certain,\nوَالنَّارَ حَقٌّ\nWAN NAARA HAQQUN\nHellfire is certain,\nوَانَّ السَّاعَةَ آتِيَةٌ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهَا\nWA ANNAS SAA-A’TA AATEYATUL LAA RAYBA FEEHAA\nthe Hour [of resurrection] will certainly come, without any dispute,\nوَانَّ اللَّهَ يَبْعَثُ مَنْ فِي الْقُبُورِ\nWA ANNAL LAAHA YAB-A’SO MAN FIL QOBOORE\nand Allah shall raise up those who are in graves.\nاللَّهُمَّ فَضْلُكَ رَجَائِي\nALLAAHUMMA FAZLOKA RAJAAA-EE\nO Allah, in Your favor do I put my hope,\nوَكَرَمُكَ وَرَحْمَتُكَ اَمَلِي\nWA KARAMOKA WA RAHMATOKA AMALEE\nYour generosity and mercy do I expect confidently,\nلَا عَمَلَ لِي اسْتَحِقُّ بِهٖ الْجَنَّةَ\nLAA A’MALA LEE ASTAHIQQO BEHIL JANNATA\nI have no single deed by which I deserve Paradise,\nوَلَا طَاعَةَ لِي اسْتَوْجِبُ بِهَا الرِّضْوَانَ\nWA LAA TAA-A’TA LEE ASTAWJEBO BEHAR RIZWAANA\nnor do I have any act of obedience [to You] due to which I deserve Your pleasure;\nاِلَّا اِنِّي اعْتَقَدتُّ تَوْحِيدَكَ وَعَدْلَكَ\nILLAA ANNEE E’TAQADTO TAWHEEDAKA WA A’DLAKA\nexcept that I believe in Your Oneness and Your Justice\nوَارْتَجَيْتُ اِحْسَانَكَ وَفَضْلَكَ\nWAR TAJAYTO EHSAANAKA WA FAZLAKA\nand I hope for Your benevolence and Your favor.\nوَتَشَفَّعْتُ اِلَيْكَ بِالنَّبِيِّ وَآلِهٖ مِنْ احِبَّتِكَ\nWA TASHAFFA’TO ELAYKA BIN-NABIYYE WA AALEHI MIN AHIBBATEKA\nI thus seek the Prophet and his Household, Your most-beloved ones, to intercede for me before You;\nوَانتَ اَكْرَمُ الاكْرَمِينَ\nWA ANTA AKRAMUL AKRAMEENA\nand You are verily the most Generous of all those who treat generously\nوَارْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِينَ\nWA ARHAMUR RAAHEMEENA\nand the most Merciful of all those who show mercy.\nوَصَلَّىٰ اللَّهُ عَلَىٰ نَبِيِّنَا مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA NABIYYENAA MOHAMMADIN\nMay Allah send blessings to Our Prophet, Muhammad\nوَآلِهٖ اَجْمَعْينَ\nWA AALEHI AJMA-E’ENA\nand upon all of his Household,\nالطَّيِّبِينَ الطَّاهِرِينَ\nATTAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA\nthe pure and immaculate,\nوَسَلَّمَ تَسْلِيماً كَثِيراً كَثِيراً\nWA SALLAMA TASLEEMAN KASEERAN KASEERAN\nand send upon them many many benedictions.\nوَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللَّهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيمِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A’LIYYIL A’ZEEME\nThere is no might and no power except with Allah, the All-high, the All-great.\nاللَّهُمَّ يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ\nALLAAHUMMA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA\nO Allah! O most Merciful of all those who show mercy,\nاِنِّي اَوْدَعْتُكَ يَقِينِي هٰذَا وَثَبَاتَ دِينِي\nINNEE AWDA’TOKA YAQEENEE HAAZAA WA SABAATA DEENEE\nI am depositing with You this faith of mine and my firmness on this belief;\nوَانتَ خَيْرُ مُسْتَوْدَعٍ\nWA ANTA KHAYRO MUSTAWDA-I’N\nand You are the ever-best of all those who keep deposits.\nوَقَدْ امَرْتَنَا بِحِفْظِ الْوَدَائِعِ\nWA QAD AMARTANAA BE-HIFZIL WADAAA-E-E’\nYou have commanded us to keep safe deposits that are put with us;\nفَرُدَّهٗ عَلَيَّ وَقْتَ حُضُورِ مَوْتِي\nFARUDDAHU A’LAYYA WAQTA HOZOORE MAWTEE\nso, (please) keep for me this deposit to give it back to me at the time of my death\nوَعِنْدَ مُسَاءَلَةِ مُنْكَرٍ وَنَكِيرٍ\nWA I’NDA MOSAAA-ALATE MUNKARINW WA NAKEERIN\nand at the time of the interrogation of Munkar and Nakir;\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ\nBE-RAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA\n[I beseech You] in the name of Your mercy; O most Merciful of all those who show mercy.\nاللَّهُمَّ اِنِّي اَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ العَدِيلَةِ عِنْدَ الْمَوْتِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE A-O’OZO BEKA MENAL A’DEELATE I’NDAL MAWTE\nO Allah, I seek Your protection against deviation at the hour of death."
}
